advantage, the potential

00:12:05.500 --> 00:12:09.640
to impact, you know, create
impact across industries.

00:12:09.640 --> 00:12:11.660
That really interested me.

00:12:11.660 --> 00:12:13.520
And the reason why I actually stuck

00:12:13.520 --> 00:12:15.890
to quantum information science,

00:12:15.890 --> 00:12:17.800
I mean, it was absolutely
very interesting,

00:12:17.800 --> 00:12:20.520
but it was because of the people around,

00:12:20.520 --> 00:12:24.770
because of the communities that
I was able to take part in.

00:12:24.770 --> 00:12:29.170
Because of my roommate
from my second year,

00:12:29.170 --> 00:12:31.150
how we kind of worked together, you know,

00:12:31.150 --> 00:12:32.810
worked through some of these concepts.

00:12:32.810 --> 00:12:35.380
And I think because of that community

00:12:35.380 --> 00:12:38.030
I was able to really prosper in

00:12:38.030 --> 00:12:40.810
and continue to develop my interest

00:12:40.810 --> 00:12:43.620
into now it is my passion and
what I'll probably continue

00:12:43.620 --> 00:12:45.413
to do for the rest of my life. Yeah.

