00:31:56.340 --> 00:31:59.560
So we have 16 programs now
that you get to pick from.

00:31:59.560 --> 00:32:03.950
So if you have a career path
in mind, you may find a variety

00:32:03.950 --> 00:32:07.710
of majors that really speak
to what your future goal is.

00:32:07.710 --> 00:32:10.560
So if your future goal is in quantum,

00:32:10.560 --> 00:32:13.560
you may want to pursue physics
instead of engineering,

00:32:13.560 --> 00:32:17.390
you may want to pursue
software engineering

00:32:17.390 --> 00:32:18.770
or material science.

00:32:18.770 --> 00:32:21.620
I know our department head
here in material science

00:32:21.620 --> 00:32:24.380
at the university of
Arizona, he's also working

00:32:24.380 --> 00:32:28.810
on a quantum computing
project using sound.

00:32:28.810 --> 00:32:32.100
So there's a lot of different
ways that you can add

00:32:32.100 --> 00:32:34.660
