outside of your major.

00:32:34.660 --> 00:32:37.320
So these research
opportunities, internships,

00:32:37.320 --> 00:32:39.310
those are all things
that can supplement you

00:32:39.310 --> 00:32:40.410
as you're going through.

00:32:40.410 --> 00:32:43.790
So it's okay to not know right now exactly

00:32:43.790 --> 00:32:45.810
what the next four years
are gonna look like.

00:32:45.810 --> 00:32:47.490
Just keep an open mind.

00:32:47.490 --> 00:32:49.710
And I would say, as you know, my advice

00:32:49.710 --> 00:32:53.360
as an admissions person is if
you're interested in a career

00:32:53.360 --> 00:32:56.830
