fields or engineering or math,

00:32:56.830 --> 00:33:01.720
in high school pursue as many
of those courses as you can,

00:33:01.720 --> 00:33:04.920
as much math especially
calculus based math.

00:33:04.920 --> 00:33:07.450
For engineering, that's
super important for us.

00:33:07.450 --> 00:33:09.870
Math and science in high school.

00:33:09.870 --> 00:33:13.160
Take whatever you can,
get involved in clubs

00:33:13.160 --> 00:33:16.280
whatever they may be whether
it's coding or robotics

00:33:16.280 --> 00:33:18.110
or whatever interests you.

00:33:18.110 --> 00:33:20.740
And you're gonna have a
great foundation coming in

00:33:20.740 --> 00:33:22.840
