00:41:25.890 --> 00:41:28.720
I see software developer roles pop up

00:41:28.720 --> 00:41:31.400
that don't require a PhD background.

00:41:31.400 --> 00:41:33.060
So this is kind of like to the point

00:41:33.060 --> 00:41:35.743
of building the infrastructure, right?

00:41:37.000 --> 00:41:40.300
Necessary to achieve something
like quantum advantage

00:41:40.300 --> 00:41:45.300
at a large scale, you don't
just need physics PhDs.

00:41:46.940 --> 00:41:49.140
You also need software engineers

00:41:49.140 --> 00:41:52.100
and a lot of other people
throughout the stack, right?

00:41:52.100 --> 00:41:53.793
So to speak of quantum computing.

00:41:55.630 --> 00:41:57.450
Yeah. So there are a lot
of transferable skills

00:41:57.450 --> 00:42:00.550
and there are opportunities
that are already popping up

00:42:00.550 --> 00:42:01.953
and will continue to pop up.

